{"translation-revision-date":"2026-07-06","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"src\/admin\/settings\/components\/tabs\/SearchConfigTab.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"de_DE","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Popular searches":["Beliebte Suchanfragen"],"Saving\u2026":[""],"No unsaved changes.":[""],"Remove field":[""],"Type":[""],"Add a field":[""],"Failed":[""],"A fallback list of queries shown as suggestions in the search modal before a visitor types anything. Search Cloud's own live popular searches are used whenever available; this list only takes over when that request comes back empty or fails.":[""],"One query per line. Used as a fallback whenever live popular searches from Search Cloud are unavailable or empty.":[""],"Preparing\u2026":[""],"Indexing\u2026":[""],"Ready":[""],"Your plan does not include this.":[""],"AI & ranking":[""],"Site-level switches that change how results are found and ordered. These are the same switches as in the Search Cloud panel.":[""],"AI search":[""],"Searches return hybrid keyword + semantic results. Turning this on starts a background re-index of your catalogue; turning it off is instant and keeps keyword search working.":[""],"Index status: %s":[""],"AI visual tagging":[""],"A vision model describes each product image and adds the tags to the document, so sparsely-described products still turn up. Applied as you sync \u2014 re-sync to tag products already indexed.":[""],"Rank results by what visitors click":[""],"Results people click most for a search rise for everyone searching it. Relevance still leads \u2014 popular results are only nudged up.":[""],"Merchandising rules":[""],"Curate the results of chosen searches. Leave the trigger empty to apply a rule to every search \u2014 that is how you keep a product out of search everywhere.":[""],"Trigger (search term contains)":[""],"Empty: this rule applies to every search on the site.":[""],"Remove rule":[""],"Pin to top (document ids)":[""],"Comma-separated, in the order they should appear.":[""],"Hide (document ids)":[""],"Comma-separated. Kept out of the results entirely.":[""],"Promotional banner":[""],"Optional message returned with the results for this search.":[""],"Add a rule":[""],"Could not load the search configuration.":[""],"Save search configuration":[""],"Search configuration":[""],"Controls how Search Cloud itself ranks and filters your content - which fields it searches and how heavily, per-type ranking boosts, which fields power facets and suggestions, and synonyms. Most of this lives on Search Cloud's side, not in this plugin's own settings, so changes take effect on the very next search.":[""],"Searchable fields & weights":[""],"Which fields full-text search matches, and how much each one counts (1\u2013100). A higher weight on \"title\" makes title matches outrank body-text matches, for example.":[""],"Field":[""],"Weight":[""],"Type boosts":[""],"Ranking boost per content type (0.1\u2013100). Above 1 ranks that type higher overall; below 1 ranks it lower. One row per content type currently enabled in Indexing.":[""],"Boost":[""],"Enable at least one content type in the Indexing tab to set a type boost.":[""],"Facet fields":[""],"Fields returned as facets on search results and allowed as filters. Click the field to browse every available field, or type to search.":[""],"Suggest fields":[""],"Fields queried for search-as-you-type suggestions. Defaults to \"title\" when left empty. Click to browse, or type to search.":[""],"Synonyms":[""],"Treats words as interchangeable during search, even when the exact word a visitor types never appears in a result. For example, a line with \"sneaker, trainer\" means searching \"sneaker\" also matches results that only mention \"trainer\", and vice versa - useful for regional spelling or naming differences.":[""],"One comma-separated group of interchangeable words per line, e.g. \"sneaker, trainer\".":[""],"Languages":[""],"Which of this site's languages to index and search. Your plan allows up to %d.":[""],"Which of this site's languages to index and search. Leave every language unchecked for unrestricted.":[""],"No WPML\/Polylang installation was detected, so languages can only be entered manually here. Leave empty for unrestricted.":[""],"Comma-separated ISO language codes, e.g. \"de, en\".":[""],"Could not save the search configuration.":[""],"Search configuration saved.":[""]}}}